{"ID":"20240515131436-xjkswjo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131436-xjkswjo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131436-xjkswjo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133717-r52w715\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133717-r52w715\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:402,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133717-r52w715\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:446,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:446\u0026#125;","title":"028","type":"doc","updated":"20240515153706"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133717-r52w715","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 919px;","id":"20240515133717-r52w715","updated":"20240515153706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：２００８／０８／２６"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CL"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"48歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/26"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多發性骨髓瘤及鼻咽癌。做過多種切片，也服過西藥治療。病人是素食者，自述已無晨舉。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.睡眠：無法一覺到天亮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.手足寒熱：手足多冷，冬天尤冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.胃口：還好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.口渴否：不會。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.大便：有時便秘，有時每日行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.體重：下降中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.體力：自六月中證實頸部淋巴結腫大實為鼻咽癌後，體力下降，且右耳聽力衰減。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.汗： 非常易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.身體寒熱感覺：中午以後身是冷，夜睡時身亦冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈沉細有力。有附骨，但不數。屬陰實"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：白乾舌，質暗紅。\n2、眼診 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":":"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 腎區幾無反應，肺區多痰濕，肝區積毒，已無圈紋。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 裡寒重症。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n生附子三錢 乾薑二錢 炙甘草四錢 龍骨五錢 桂枝四錢 白芍四錢\n當歸二錢 木通三錢 細辛二錢 牡蠣一兩 絡石藤四錢 陽起石三錢\n瓦楞子五錢 炮附子五錢 生薑二片 防己三錢"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 帖   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說： \n凡遇骨中腫瘤，用當歸四逆湯必效。病人口不渴，證為裡寒。加四逆湯去裡寒，生附重用至三錢。病人午後身不熱，證明陰陽格拒只在三焦，尚未內陷至臟，若陰實至於臟腑，身必潮熱。乃以防己為使，帶領牡蠣、瓦楞子入三焦腺體以攻堅。凡喉頸舌之陰積，須得絡石藤開其閉。病人自述不舉，腎區無反應，用陽起石振興腎陽。病人易汗，非心力足也，實為表陽虛津液不守，無力固表，故用炮附固表。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}